# The [[foundation]]; the [[basic]] or [[fundamental]] parts that support or allow for the rest.
#: {{ux|en|The discovery of the laws of electricity laid the '''groundwork''' for a century of innovation.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1961|month=December|title=Planning the London Midland main-line electrification|journal=Trains Illustrated|page=720|text=This outline programme was compiled by a working party consisting of members from the Regional Planning Office, the civil, mechanical and electrical, and signal engineering departments and the traffic services, on the basis of much '''groundwork''' done within each of these departments.}}

